# NOTE: package.json "files" is the authoritative whitelist for published contents.
# This .npmignore is only a secondary safety net. At the package root it does NOT
# override entries listed in "files" (verified with `npm pack --dry-run`):
# scripts/postinstall.cjs and scripts/preuninstall.cjs still ship despite the
# old `scripts/` rule below being removed.
#
# Everything not in "files" is already excluded from the tarball, so the verbose
# source/config ignores that used to live here are unnecessary. We keep only the
# OS / editor junk that should never ship, as defense-in-depth.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.swp
*.swo
*~
